  "term": "CRM",
  "definition": "CRM stands for cardio-renal multimorbidity, meaning that cardiovascular disease and chronic kidney disease are present together in the same person. The term refers to these two conditions as linked and mutually influencing, with shared underlying processes and overlapping outcomes.",
